<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH F.A. CUP SEMIFINALS DRAW.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH F.A. CUP SEMIFINALS DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The draw for the semifinals of</p>
<p>the English F.A. Cup made on Sunday:</p>
<p>Wimbledon v Chelsea</p>
<p>Middlesbrough v Chesterfield</p>
<p>Matches to be played on Sunday  April 13, venues to be</p>
<p>decided.</p>
</text>
